{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n除咗經典名酒，現場仲有以日本酒為基底嘅果酒同 Sparkling Sake 等特別酒款，畀大家有機會免費試飲，接觸多啲唔同類型嘅清酒！🥂 更大驚喜係，連人氣動漫 Chiikawa 角色「栗子饅頭」飲過嘅同款清酒都會登場，粉絲絕對要嚟朝聖打卡！📸\n</p>\n<p>有靚酒當然唔少得美食，同場更設有多款小食配搭，畀你一次過歎盡美酒佳餚！🍴無論係清酒新手定係資深唎酒師，都可以喺度發掘到心水靚酒～</p>\n<p>聽講仲要係免費入場添啊🫨，快啲mark實日子約埋班friend一齊去飲番杯啦！🫵🏻</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309522215521676_12498702826ae07636a57d4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309522215521676_12498702826ae07636a57d4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/De_boMoDYsY/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T10:21:52.152843+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":300,"images":1,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T10:00:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T10:58:41.953865+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T10:18:35.903636+00:00","content_hash":"8d3c342d5bca039af5296313bddd124f64adc7caae7b73acfb509e70c6b3062f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}